        "TileImage": "$($repository 441619df-c52b-4272-b71e-6c289e435c68).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Morocco\r\rYour targets consists of elite soldiers tasked to evacuate Claus Hugo Strandberg and General Zaydan. While the coup is ongoing, our on-site intelligence have confirmed that these soldiers were once the Anti-Furry Mercenaries and coincidentally, Claus Strandberg who made an investment fraud also lure some furries for false promises. The client asked us to eliminate the targets in an explosive accidents. For additional bonuses, destroy every cars in the underground lot.",
